      "chunk_index": 1,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "text": "API 510 Section 7.1 specifies calculation of corrosion rate and remaining life: Cr = (t_initial - t_actual) / Time. If remaining life is under 2 years, immediate maintenance turnaround is required."
